Task: ALB False-Positive Access Denial Fix
- Updated NetworkResourceScraper to check StackitConstants.isServiceDisabled before isPermissionIssue
- Demoted disabled ALB logs from warn to debug level
- Ensured disabled ALB services do not set permissionDenied=true and do not record ACCESS_DENIED in AccessIssueRegistry
- Added unit tests in NetworkResourceScraperTest verifying disabled service handling vs true permission denial
- Created/Modified files: NetworkResourceScraper.java, NetworkResourceScraperTest.java
- Why: STACKIT ALB API returns HTTP 403 'Service not enabled' when ALB is disabled in a region, which was incorrectly treated as a permission denial
